invariant: INV-7
file: quic.c
catches: quic_driver_test
reason: ch_quic_switch_version switches to a version this build derives
  no keys for, so every Initial packet after it is refused and the
  handshake cannot finish. test/quic_version_tests.h requires CH_EINVAL
  for 0, version 2 and two versions no RFC this build carries defines.

--- old
    if (!switch_open(q) || !quic_version_derived(version) ||
        version == q->t.quic_negotiated_version) {
--- new
    if (!switch_open(q) || version == q->t.quic_negotiated_version) {
